   "reason": "Cumulative signed circular commitments (equity, guarantees, take-or-pay, backstops; LOIs, talks and self-reported aggregates excluded): Dec 2025 $641B, Mar 2026 $673B, Jun 2026 $798B, Sep 2026 $903B. Rising by far more than the $20B dead band each quarter; the largest single items are OpenAI's $300B Oracle contract (reported), $250B Azure commitment (Microsoft blog), Nvidia's $105B lease guarantee (10-Q) and Anthropic's $100B+ AWS commitment (Amazon). Initial seed.",
