 "sublayer_id": null,
 "timing_rationale": "Leading: vendor financing is signed before the compute is delivered or used, so commitments run ahead of revenue and capacity.",
 "tracker_interpretation": "Over a trillion dollars of circular commitments in a year, most of it filed. The Nvidia 5-year CDS (on the ledger) is the market's stress read on it.",
 "unit": "USD",
 "unpublished_reason": null,
 "updated_at": "2026-09-10",
 "valve_measured": null,
 "why_it_matters": "When Nvidia guarantees OpenAI's leases, Microsoft's backlog is half OpenAI, and Amazon funds the customer that commits to AWS, revenue and capital are the same dollars going round the stack. The ledger is where the circularity is filed."
